│                          │ correlation transformations rather than merely adding redundant commuting gates. The      │
│                          │ fixed shifted links increase nonlocal correlation coverage without adding trainable       │
│                          │ degrees of freedom, aiming to improve worst-group separation while preserving strong      │
│                          │ few-shot regularization.                                                                  │
