│ patch_description        │ This crossover retains the current program’s symmetry-preserving Möbius CZ network while  │
│                          │ adopting the stronger prior program’s single shared circuit parameter, ring-based ZZ      │
│                          │ correlation layer, and readout-aligned CRZ layer. Sharing one angle across all            │
│                          │ parameterized gates reduces the model from four total parameters to three, improving      │
│                          │ parameter efficiency and few-shot regularization. The fixed CZ network supplies           │
│                          │ parameter-free local and long-range mixing, while ZZ and CRZ operations directly          │
│                          │ emphasize pair correlations relevant to the fixed two-qubit readout. The unchanged        │
│                          │ training and evaluation code preserves all original inputs and outputs.                   │
