│ patch_description        │ This crossover preserves the empirically stronger readout-aligned CRZ layer while         │
│                          │ retaining the current program’s disjoint-matching edge order. All adaptive gates share    │
│                          │ one parameter, so the model still has only three total trainable values including gain    │
│                          │ and bias. The Möbius CZ backbone supplies local and opposite-wire propagation, shared     │
│                          │ ring ZZ gates process symmetric correlations, and final directional CRZ gates align the   │
│                          │ transformed state with the dataset’s measured pairs. Reordering commuting ring            │
│                          │ interactions into matchings preserves the functional circuit of the stronger prior        │
│                          │ candidate while exposing more parallelism and reducing unnecessary depth.                 │
